    "_X5_note": "Modification policy content is a gift to the future. The author who wrote the code knows its risks intimately. X1 captures that knowledge before it walks out the door. Three tiers, specific elements, explicit blast radius — the maintainer inherits wisdom, not just code.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Proverbs 22:28 — Remove not the ancient landmark, which thy fathers have set."
